+	 * io-domain voltages declare the board's actual rail per bank; values
+	 * taken from the RGB30 4.x vendor DTB (the X55-base port had pmuio2 and
+	 * vccio5 at the wrong voltage, which degraded high-speed SDIO signalling
+	 * on sdmmc2 -> rtw88 -110 SDIO timeouts).
