+ * (PA3-PA6 bus / PA7 cmd / PB0 clk / PB2 detect) per the mainline
+ * rk3566-powkiddy-rk2023.dtsi -> rgb30 -- clear of the joypad (gpio3), the
+ * analog mux (gpio0 PB5-PB7) and the WiFi/BT pins. vqmmc is the fixed 1.8V
+ * vcc1v8_dvp rail (this slot's I/O domain, vccio2, is 1.8V in hardware), so
