+/*
+ * HDMI audio: the base hdmi-sound simple-audio-card links i2s0 (CPU DAI) ->
+ * hdmi (codec). Both default to disabled, so the "HDMI" ALSA card never
+ * appeared and audio could not route to HDMI. Enable both. i2s0 -> HDMI is an
+ * internal SoC connection (no external pins).
